            <ArticleTitle>The complications of tissue expansion in the burned scalp.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>273-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Our initial experience with tissue expansion in the reconstruction of the burned scalp is discussed. We discuss the complications encountered, their management and how these may be minimized.</AbstractText>
